ge Sequence_017_0000.png", "id": "1439689386757080", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75549081_1439689390090413_4681297363425989965_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EiqfTIpNMFMQ7kNvwESV75J&_nc_oc=AdnNhEt7HnIf0Uw22SlGcKhxVMWEOkOfce1neaVKu3MyCyAM8soZyw16WOh64vzCopU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuoPo1kqBxQ9u6cuwbIYx8wBJxm29yzSbRxvSG9soV2YA&oe=699C307F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Image Sequence_011_0000.png", "id": "755989206514620", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86655523_755989209847953_115828304606020556_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tN7j0MKq7GQQ7kNvwFBxuDi&_nc_oc=Adnol7aYCF9OJz5JL8GyOkvs3Rg7bv9bmP8z8XIK-6ey0UP93082E0seLzrY0sE7YqM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuSbvSdShGf9bG8CT05eoQc64N8AESu1MoccD-Cn6WKHw&oe=699C387F"}, "display_name": "Vokal Pop Up Gallery", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Leading African Women Against Historical Backdrops is a groundbreaking VR experience that transports you to a virtual museum where you'll encounter extraordinary African women who have shaped history.\n\nImmerse Yourself in Their Stories:\n\nEach exhibit features a captivating video interview on the \"front wall\" of a VR museum room. These inspiring women will share their stories directly with you, drawing you into their experiences.\n\nExplore the Context:\n\nThe side panels of the virtual room come alive with rich content that complements each woman's narrative. Informative text and captivating visuals provide historical context, giving you a deeper understanding of the times they lived in.", "short_description": "Leading African Women Against Historical Backdrops."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sisanda.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sisanda Tech", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sisanda.c